    <h1>The Torque Ledger</h1>
    <p class="cover__sub">Maintenance · Restoration · History</p>
  </div>
  <p class="hero__lead">A careful, plain-spoken manual for the hands-on classic-car owner. Whether you turn every wrench yourself or simply want to understand what your mechanic is doing, The Torque Ledger explains the essentials of keeping and restoring an older car — clearly, methodically, and always with safety first. Think of it as the trusted manual on the shelf, ready whenever a job needs doing or a question needs an answer.</p>
</div>
